{
  "assessment_scope": "Independent integrated Code Review of both M1 document/example relocation and M2 reader implementation under directory-design-review and directory-delivery-review, after correction. This is the complete directory slice, not final whole-unified-validation-initiative Code Review.",
  "change_id": "2026-09-12-unified-validation-model",
  "contributors": [
    {
      "id": "root",
      "role": "implement"
    }
  ],
  "findings": [
    {
      "evidence": "Severity: major. Location: scripts/validation_selection.py:7 and isolated CI-workspace fixtures in scripts/test-select-validation.py. New unconditional import of PROJECT_MODEL_PATHS from boundary_first_validation adds an undeclared runtime dependency to copied selector workspaces. /tmp/layout-selector.log reports 23 failed / 143 passed; representative test_boundary_sibling_failures_each_block_selected_execution fails with ModuleNotFoundError: No module named boundary_first_validation before any Run selected check output. This prevents real wrapper integration coverage and violates coordinated-reader M2 proof.",
      "id": "directory-selector-dependency",
      "owner": {
        "id": "root",
        "role": "implement"
      },
      "reporter": {
        "id": "proposal-reviewer",
        "role": "review"
      },
      "required_outcome": "Support the path map dependency in every actual selector/CI workspace consumer while retaining independent real-wrapper assertions. Use a bounded dependency-free shared owner or explicitly provide necessary module closure; preserve exact-map and fail-closed behavior. Run the focused reproducer and complete selector suite, then reassess the full bounded slice. No new product/Design decision is required.",
      "resolution": {
        "actor": {
          "id": "proposal-reviewer",
          "role": "review"
        },
        "evidence_refs": [
          {
            "id": "directory-layout-proof",
            "path": "docs/changes/2026-09-12-unified-validation-model/evidence.json"
          }
        ],
        "rationale": "The full boundary-validator import was replaced with dependency-free scripts/model_layout.py. Both consumers and both isolated workspace constructors include the bounded dependency; new module-change selection test protects both reader suites. Full selector rerun passes all 167 cases after the original 23 integration failures, boundary 90 and metadata 8 also pass. Independent complete-directory reassessment finds the required outcome satisfied; original finding identity, subjects and failure evidence remain preserved."
      },
      "state": "resolved",
      "subjects": [
        {
